# Read by BuildKit for `docker build -f studio/Dockerfile`. A file the image
# is built from must come from the commit, not from a developer's working
# tree: installs, build output and credentials never enter the context
# (CI-006). The staged CanvasKit (studio/.canvaskit) is the one ignored-by-git
# input the build needs, and it stays.
.git
**/node_modules
studio/apps/web/dist
studio/apps/web/src/features/plugin-canvas/canvaskit
studio/packages/validator/build
studio/coverage
studio/test-results
studio/playwright-report
build
deploy/compose/.secrets
